39952841810c.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/896c39952841810c.webp 720w",80,"Ana Scarabelli","ChannelEngine · Ana Scarabelli","vgijh8jk4y62y9un00mwt2cel","亚马逊巴西加入 YouTube Shopping 联盟计划","亚马逊巴西宣布加入 YouTube Shopping 联盟计划，允许创作者在视频中标记 Amazon.com.br 商品并获取佣金。该合作同时覆盖亚马逊网站和 App，将创作者视频引入首页及订单确认页等场景。亚马逊援引数据显示，YouTube 在巴西拥有 1.3 亿月活跃用户，2026 年购物相关视频消费量较 2025 年增长超 120%。",{"_116":492},"2026-09-29T09:34:44.000Z","2026-09-30T09:35:26.053Z",[134,115,114],40,{"_108":491,"_110":171},[532],{"_96":97,"_98":533,"_100":534,"_102":535,"_104":-5,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/afb2c73a3019d6d1.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/afb2c73a3019d6d1.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/afb2c73a3019d6d1.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/afb2c73a3019d6d1.webp 720w","h478rwmp0ly2vwg0vka4skbdc","TikTok Shop LIVE 是人员配置问题，不是内容问题","TikTok Shop LIVE 直播失败多因运营结构问题，而非内容质量差。原文指出直播需要主播、副播、场控、制片、运营五个角色，小团队可一人多角色但每个职责需有明确负责人；建议先搭好运营流程再增加直播频次，并强调真实稀缺、真实社会证明、合规宣称与诚实定价。",{"_116":476},"2026-09-29T16:00:00.000Z",[134,115,136,114],{"_108":472,"_110":473},[544],{"_96":97,"_98":545,"_100":546,"_102":547,"_104":-5,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/8a853d3391c088db.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/8a853d3391c088db.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/8a853d3391c088db.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/8a853d3391c088db.webp 720w","ygzemmdkltvcb8dkov2daueru","亚马逊卖家分享清仓转售经验","一位 eBay 小卖家称近 30 天通过随机亚马逊转售获利近 $10k，单笔销售在不到一周内赚取 +$56.20。作者认为无最佳单一模式，建议寻找适合自身且能持续精进的方法，并强调保持开放心态、承认无知及向他人学习的重要性。",{"_116":276},"2026-09-30T11:45:33.000Z","2026-10-17T15:58:17.595Z",[134,115],15,[],{"_262":263,"_264":265,"_266":267,"_268":269,"_92":558,"_271":-5},[559,560],{"_96":97,"_98":565,"_100":566,"_102":567,"_104":292,"_105":568,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},{"_96":97,"_98":561,"_100":562,"_102":563,"_104":292,"_105":564,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1213,"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1078,"pzqu8pmou0xbdvx2al477d6bp","亚马逊扩展 Seller Central 多渠道管理并推出 MCF 新激励","亚马逊将 Seller Central 扩展为可连接 eBay、Shopify、TikTok Shop 及 Walmart 的多渠道管理环境，支持导入商品、查看订单并使用亚马逊履约。原文称，Amazon Supply Chain Services 客户在使用 Multichannel Fulfillment 时，可为其自有网站新增 Prime 配送且无需额外费用；MCF Preferred Pricing 则依据符合条件的销量，将履约费用降低 15% 至 25%。原文来自该机构，存在相关商业利益，并非独立测评。",{"_116":585},"2026-09-30T14:00:48.000Z","2026-10-11T18:46:08.796Z",[188,115,207,114],{"_108":-5,"_110":584},[578],{"_96":97,"_98":579,"_100":580,"_102":581,"_104":582,"_105":583,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/69d4898e884a1b36.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/69d4898e884a1b36.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/69d4898e884a1b36.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/69d4898e884a1b36.webp 720w",996,312,"BellaVix","BellaVix · Amazon与Walmart运营洞察","cdtnt0w78e4p03wadrto7fgo8","GeekSeller 支持 TikTok FBT MCF 多渠道履约，提供中性包装与快速追踪","GeekSeller 于 2026 年 8 月初上线对 TikTok FBT MCF（Fulfilled by TikTok Multichannel Fulfillment）的支持，允许卖家利用 TikTok 库存履行来自 Walmart、Amazon 等外部渠道的订单。",{"_116":600},"2026-09-30T21:35:46.000Z","2026-10-22T18:36:27.985Z",[207,115,474],{"_108":-5,"_110":599},[595],{"_96":97,"_98":596,"_100":597,"_102":598,"_104":-5,"_105":-5,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5ffd502588caf404.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5ffd502588caf404.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5ffd502588caf404.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/5ffd502588caf404.webp 720w","GeekSeller","GeekSeller · 多平台卖家博客","odw4ec5rmuv9i6zl6wtiy21dd","RepricerExpress 谈沃尔玛动态定价：第三方卖家如何按自设规则自动调价","原文来自 RepricerExpress，介绍其沃尔玛调价工具：按卖家自设的最低价与最高价，自动监控竞品报价并调整价格。文中提到沃尔玛“价格平价规则”（沃尔玛售价不得高于亚马逊等其他渠道）、约 3% 的竞争窗口以及 Polaris 算法将价格作为搜索排名信号等说法，其中约 3% 窗口标注来源为 Maxmerce（2025 年 12 月），本站尚未独立核验该引用；原文另给出 WFS 目标 2-3%、卖家自配送 1-2% 等口径，并称激活后需 72-96 小时再评估效果，这些均属作者观点与建议，不构成效果保证。原文来自该机构，存在相关商业利益，并非独立测评。",{"_116":189},"2026-10-01T10:17:13.000Z",[134,115,237],{"_108":186,"_110":187},[],"d1ihtd3s14jhk716dtf4vnsr3","2026年沃尔玛Repricer选型指南：FBA与Walmart卖家需关注的五大标准","RepricerExpress 发布指南，建议卖家依据 Buy Box 数据、WFS 履约感知及价格平价规则等五项标准评估 Walmart Repricer。文章指出 Walmart 算法要求价格处于最低价约 3% 的竞争窗口内，且 WFS 商品赢得购物车概率比自发货高 68%。通用工具若未直接对接 Walmart API 或区分履约类型，易导致定价错误及合规风险。",{"_116":189},"2026-10-01T10:24:17.000Z",[236,237,115],{"_108":186,"_110":187},[],"yg0aejk83de82ad3kcnkd7jid","TikTok Shop 2026年卖家资格与注册指南","TikTok Shop 公布 2026 年美国卖家资格要求，需年满 18 岁、持有美国身份证件及银行账户，无最低粉丝数限制。平台收取 6% 推荐费，新店铺进入试用期并受每日订单上限约束。截至 2026 年中，TikTok Shop 已在 20 个国家运营本地市场。",{"_116":634},"2026-10-01T21:54:48.000Z","2026-10-09T05:26:52.777Z",[188,115],{"_108":632,"_110":633},[626],{"_96":97,"_98":627,"_100":628,"_102":629,"_104":630,"_105":631,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/00a5eec837d67364.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/00a5eec837d67364.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/00a5eec837d67364.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/00a5eec837d67364.webp 720w",1792,1024,"Chuck Kessler","Canopy Management","Canopy Management 亚马逊运营与广告文章","eylxxhziiab1xiytpz4trogks","如何让产品在 ChatGPT 购物结果中被推荐","作者指出，自2026年9月4日起，ChatGPT 购物结果仅展示提交了产品 feed 的品牌。由于亚马逊屏蔽了 OpenAI 爬虫，亚马逊卖家需建立带有结构化数据的 DTC 站点，并确保 feed、商品页和亚马逊链接的信息一致，以便 ChatGPT 准确描述产品。原文来自 SellerElevate，存在相关商业利益，并非独立测评。作者提示所有规则与要求截至2026年10月，行动前需向 OpenAI 和 Shopify 确认最新 feed 规范与资格。",{"_116":652},"2026-10-02T17:11:50.000Z","2026-10-09T06:34:23.839Z",[134,173,136,115,114],61,{"_108":650,"_110":651},[645],{"_96":97,"_98":646,"_100":647,"_102":648,"_104":631,"_105":649,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/42bb34c6e794536c.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/42bb34c6e794536c.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/42bb34c6e794536c.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/42bb34c6e794536c.webp 720w",538,"Mohammad Jalil (MJ)","SellerElevate","SellerElevate 亚马逊广告与运营文章","k1zomxsj7cck2scglsl5ynd1f","Eightx 模型测算 TikTok Shop 2026 年综合抽成率约 46.7%","Eightx 的 2026 年 7 月模型测算，TikTok Shop 首年商品综合抽成率约为 GMV 的 46.7%，区间为 38% 至 52%。该数据包含物流、达人佣金及广告等成本，远超基础佣金；尽管有机构报告称美国区佣金于 2026 年 8 月涨至 8%，但官方费率表仍显示 6%，卖家需以结算单为准。",{"_116":652},"2026-10-02T17:21:50.000Z",[188,665,115],{"_108":650,"_110":651},[661],{"_96":97,"_98":662,"_100":663,"_102":664,"_104":631,"_105":649,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5306bb50b3e7e422.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5306bb50b3e7e422.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/5306bb50b3e7e422.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/5306bb50b3e7e422.webp 720w","费用变更","jw0k0i3dabhd1uj8vxv91xbku","亚马逊接入 YouTube 购物计划，创作者可标记商品","自2026年8月27日起，符合条件的美国创作者可在YouTube视频中标记亚马逊商品以赚取佣金。品牌无法直接通过卖家平台注册产品，且缺乏视频级归因数据，作者建议将部分达人营销预算用于测试该渠道而非全面转移。",{"_116":652},"2026-10-02T17:31:50.000Z",[134,114,115],58,{"_108":650,"_110":651},[675],{"_96":97,"_98":676,"_100":677,"_102":678,"_104":631,"_105":649,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/c74a6dc4b04e7b6d.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/c74a6dc4b04e7b6d.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/c74a6dc4b04e7b6d.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/c74a6dc4b04e7b6d.webp 720w","vhuu3tqno1h62euyvkx2erxp1","Shopify 推出 Agentic Storefronts：支持在 ChatGPT、Gemini 和 Copilot 销售","Shopify 于 2026 年 3 月 24 日上线 Agentic Storefronts，默认向符合条件的店铺开放，通过 Shopify Catalog 将产品同步至 ChatGPT、Gemini、Copilot 及 Google AI Mode。",{"_116":652},"2026-10-02T19:51:50.000Z","2026-10-09T06:34:23.230Z",[134,115,136],{"_108":650,"_110":651},[688],{"_96":97,"_98":689,"_100":690,"_102":691,"_104":631,"_105":649,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/e7eae92f2b9baf01.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/e7eae92f2b9baf01.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/e7eae92f2b9baf01.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/e7eae92f2b9baf01.webp 720w","safeiuizmhl4x5v4qq8ws8gew","TikTok Shop 降低联盟佣金上限，卖家应如何调整创作者支付策略","据 Novadata 和 beBOLD 报道，TikTok Shop 于 2026 年 6 月 22 日左右下调默认联盟佣金上限，美妆等类目典型分成从约 20% 降至 10-15%，但 Ecommerce Times 称降幅仅 2-4 个百分点。卖家仍可自行设定合作费率，建议对核心 SKU 和已验证创作者支付溢价，其余保持接近新默认值。",{"_116":652},"2026-10-02T20:21:50.000Z","2026-10-09T06:34:22.435Z",[134,115,172],{"_108":650,"_110":651},[701],{"_96":97,"_98":702,"_100":703,"_102":704,"_104":631,"_105":649,"_106":-5,"_107":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/2efa23fc09b31e4b.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/2efa23fc09b31e4b.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/2efa23fc09b31e4b.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/2efa23fc09b31e4b.webp 720w","all","tag","topic","q","tab","time","order","original","collectedSince",{"_715":716},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
